This module is Termux's terminal-emulator library, taken from
https://github.com/termux/termux-app (commit 8629e63), which is released under
the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). It is based on Terminal Emulator for
Android by Jack Palevich (Apache 2.0).

Changes made for Router Home:
- TerminalSession.java is rewritten: instead of starting a local shell through
  native code (JNI), it shows what an SSH connection sends and passes typed
  input to it (setLink / feed / disconnected).
- JNI.java and the native code (src/main/jni) are removed.
- build.gradle is new (no native build, no publishing).
